title: "ConstelLink"
abstract: "Constellation link planning over a time-varying contact graph — sgp4 propagation, inter-satellite and ground contact windows, Dijkstra on a time-expanded graph, ILP max-flow scheduling, RF and optical capacity models; calibrated link-availability predictor against climatology and logistic baselines."
